ts et coups critiques\",\n [\"Spells / rings / trinkets\"] = \"Sorts / anneaux / bijoux\",\n [\"Split into 20 segments\"] = \"Diviser en 20 segments\",\n [\"Square minimap (off: round)\"] = \"Minicarte carrée (désactivée : ronde)\",\n [\"Standard\"] = \"Standard\",\n [\"Started with\"] = \"Au départ\",\n [\"Starting luck unavailable\"] = \"Chance initiale indisponible\",\n [\"Stat counter [WIP]\"] = \"Compteur de statistiques [EN COURS]\",\n [\"Stat display\"] = \"Affichage des statistiques\",\n [\"Stats\"] = \"Statistiques\",\n [\"Stats category\"] = \"Catégorie de statistiques\",\n [\"Stop sound\"] = \"Stop sound\",\n [\"Stretch across the whole screen\"] = \"Étirer sur toute la largeur de l'écran\",\n [\"Successful revive\"] = \"Réanimation réussie\",\n [\"Support\"] = \"Assistance\",\n [\"Switch to horizontal\"] = \"Passer à l’horizontale\",\n [\"Switch to vertical\"] = \"Passer à la verticale\",\n [\"Taking the scenic route\"] = \"Taking the scenic route\",\n [\"Talent\"] = \"Talent\",\n [\"Target buffs/debuffs\"] = \"Améliorations/affaiblissements de la cible\",\n [\"Target buffs/debuffs position\"] = \"Position des améliorations et affaiblissements de la cible\",\n [\"Target frame\"] = \"Cadre de la cible\",\n [\"Target frame look\"] = \"Apparence du cadre de la cible\",\n [\"Target's buffs and debuffs\"] = \"Améliorations et affaiblissements de la cible\",\n [\"Teammate Death\"] = \"Teammate Death\",\n [\"Teammate death sound\"] = \"Son de mort des coéquipiers\",\n [\"Teammate revive sound\"] = \"Son de réanimation d'allié\",\n [\"Teammate revive sound (when you helped revive them)\"] = \"Son de réanimation d’un coéquipier (si vous avez aidé à le relever)\",\n [\"That's everything. Press Finish to lock the UI. You can move anything again with Toggle UI Settings. Done closes the list.\"] = \"C’est terminé. Cliquez sur Terminer pour verrouiller l’interface. Vous pourrez tout déplacer à nouveau avec les réglages d’interface. Terminé ferme la liste.\",\n [\"The Price Is Right: losing horn\"] = \"The Price Is Right : trompette de défaite\",\n [\"The bar shown while you bring a friend back.\"] = \"La barre affichée pendant que vous réanimez un ami.\",\n [\"The chat window, its tab and the box you type in move together.\"] = \"La fenêtre de discussion, son onglet et la zone de saisie se déplacent ensemble.\",\n [\"The enemy the game has picked for you.\"] = \"L’ennemi choisi pour vous par le jeu.\",\n [\"The game's nearest Guardian lair flag\"] = \"Repère du repaire de gardien le plus proche\",\n [\"The game's own layout\"] = \"Disposition d’origine du jeu\",\n [\"The game's own versions of these parts can't be moved. To move one, say yes below: Slim Suite swaps in its own movable copy. Each copy's other settings are in its menu: right-click it in Toggle UI Settings.\"] = \"Les versions d’origine du jeu ne peuvent pas être déplacées. Activez-en une ci-dessous pour que Slim Suite la remplace par une version mobile. Ses options sont dans son menu : faites un clic droit dessus dans les réglages d’interface.\",\n [\"The goal of clearing up chat is to see your friends' chat better in multiplayer.\"] = \"Le nettoyage du chat aide à mieux voir les messages de vos amis en multijoueur.\",\n [\"The local clock sits inside the minimap, and the minimap is Off, so the clock is hidden too.\"] = \"L'horloge locale est dans la minicarte, et la minicarte est désactivée, donc l'horloge est cachée aussi.\",\n [\"The meter. Its corner grip resizes it any time.\"] = \"Le compteur. Sa poignée d’angle permet de le redimensionner à tout moment.\",\n [\"The minimap, with its pins.\"] = \"La minicarte et ses repères.\",\n [\"The movable Level Up button and its store toggle.\"] = \"Le bouton Niveau supérieur déplaçable et sa commande de stockage.\",\n [\"The party frames are joined to the player frame, but the player frame is Off.\"] = \"Les cadres de groupe sont attachés au cadre de joueur, mais le cadre de joueur est désactivé.\",\n [\"Thick\"] = \"Épaisse\",\n [\"Thin lines\"] = \"Lignes fines\",\n [\"This view reports detected client and game hooks. Missing optional hooks do not necessarily prevent Slim Suite's core HUD features from working.\"] = \"Cette vue présente les fonctions détectées du client et du jeu. L’absence de fonctions facultatives n’empêche pas forcément les principales fonctions HUD de Slim Suite.\",\n [\"Thorns\"] = \"Épines\",\n [\"Tick: On. Empty: Off. D: Default (the game's own). Click a name with Advanced Options on to chain it.\"] = \"Coché : activé. Vide : désactivé. D : par défaut (celui du jeu). Avec les options avancées, cliquez sur un nom pour l'attacher.\",\n [\"To Be Continued JoJo\"] = \"To Be Continued JoJo\",\n [\"Toggle UI Settings\"] = \"Afficher les réglages d’interface\",\n [\"Toggle UI Settings (drag, resize and scale)\"] = \"Réglages d’interface (déplacer, redimensionner et mettre à l’échelle)\",\n [\"Tooltip\"] = \"Infobulle\",\n [\"Tooltip width\"] = \"Largeur des infobulles\",\n [\"Top\"] = \"Haut\",\n [\"Tracking from\"] = \"Suivi depuis\",\n [\"Transparent minimap (round or square, no borders)\"] = \"Minicarte transparente (ronde ou carrée, sans bordure)\",\n [\"Turn each element on, off, or back to the game's own.\"] = \"Activez, désactivez ou rendez chaque élément au jeu.\",\n [\"Turn off the game's nearest Guardian lair flag\"] = \"Désactiver le drapeau de repaire de gardien le plus proche du jeu\",\n [\"Turn the XP bar vertical\"] = \"Mettre la barre d’expérience à la verticale\",\n [\"Turn the action bar vertical\"] = \"Mettre la barre d’action à la verticale\",\n [\"Turns off: Buffs on the target frame.\"] = \"Désactive : Améliorations sur le cadre de la cible.\",\n [\"Turns off: Buffs/Debuffs on the player frame.\"] = \"Désactive : Améliorations/affaiblissements sur le cadre du joueur.\",\n [\"Turns off: Join the party yourself. Combines both frames and mirrors their positions at the same size.\"] = \"Désactive : Rejoindre le groupe. Combine les deux cadres et reproduit leur position à la même taille.\",\n [\"Turns off: Join the party yourself. The player frame takes the target's look.\"] = \"Désactive : Rejoindre le groupe. Le cadre du joueur reprend l’apparence de la cible.\",\n [\"Turns off: your player frame (back when unticked) and Mirror Target. Your frame joins the party list.\"] = \"Désactive : votre cadre de joueur (rétabli au décochage) et Refléter la cible. Votre cadre rejoint le groupe.\",\n [\"Type a word in the search box at the top (hide, clock, boss, size, party...) and every setting about it opens.\"] = \"Tapez un mot dans la recherche en haut (masquer, horloge, boss, taille, groupe...) et chaque réglage concerné s'ouvre.\",\n [\"UI\"] = \"Interface\",\n [\"Unchain\"] = \"Détacher\",\n [\"Under or above the player frame takes you out of the party frames and makes the party movable.\"] = \"Sous ou au-dessus du cadre du joueur, vous quitte des cadres du groupe et permet de les déplacer.\",\n [\"Under the player frame\"] = \"Sous le cadre du joueur\",\n [\"Undo\"] = \"Annuler\",\n [\"Undo and Redo at the bottom of the settings (or /slim undo, /slim redo) step through your last 25 changes. /slim log shows every change.\"] = \"Annuler et Rétablir, en bas des paramètres (ou /slim undo, /slim redo), parcourent vos 25 dernières modifications. /slim log montre chaque modification.\",\n [\"Unit frame\"] = \"Cadre d’unité\",\n [\"Unofficial side objectives — no gameplay rewards.\"] = \"Unofficial side objectives — no gameplay rewards.\",\n [\"Updated enabled elements; Default and Disabled elements were left alone.\"] = \"Les éléments activés ont été mis à jour ; les éléments par défaut ou désactivés sont restés inchangés.\",\n [\"Use LEGO die instead of Baby Crying\"] = \"Utiliser LEGO die à la place de Baby Crying\",\n [\"Use global soundtrack\"] = \"Use global soundtrack\",\n [\"Use modern Slim Suite enemy frames\"] = \"Utiliser les cadres ennemis modernes de Slim Suite\",\n [\"Use this layout\"] = \"Utiliser cette disposition\",\n [\"User Interface\"] = \"Interface utilisateur\",\n [\"Utility stats\"] = \"Statistiques utilitaires\",\n [\"Vertical\"] = \"Vertical\",\n [\"Vertical (off: horizontal)\"] = \"Vertical (désactivé : horizontal)\",\n [\"Victory lap club\"] = \"Victory lap club\",\n [\"Victory sound\"] = \"Son de victoire\",\n [\"Where event announcements appear.\"] = \"Emplacement des annonces d’événement.\",\n [\"Where the big damage numbers appear\"] = \"Où apparaissent les gros chiffres de dégâts\",\n [\"Where tooltips appear, and how wide they are. Each one is as tall as its own text.\"] = \"Emplacement et largeur des infobulles. Chacune s’adapte à la hauteur de son texte.\",\n [\"Whip Crack\"] = \"Claquement de fouet\",\n [\"Width\"] = \"Largeur\",\n [\"Win 10 observed runs.\"] = \"Win 10 observed runs.\",\n [\"Win an observed Heroic run.\"] = \"Win an observed Heroic run.\",\n [\"Window text size\"] = \"Taille du texte des fenêtres\",\n [\"World damage display\"] = \"Dégâts dans le monde\",\n [\"Worn rings / trinkets row joins the build spell row\"] = \"La rangée d'anneaux / bijoux portés s'attache à la rangée de sorts\",\n [\"XP bar\"] = \"Barre d’expérience\",\n [\"XP bonus\"] = \"Bonus d’expérience\",\n [\"Your Death\"] = \"Your Death\",\n [\"Your Death Sound\"] = \"Your Death Sound\",\n [\"Your buffs and debuffs. Below, stack them in a column and choose which way they grow. Attached to the target frame, they move and scale with it instead.\"] = \"Vos améliorations et affaiblissements. Ci-dessous, empilez-les en colonne et choisissez leur direction. Attachés au cadre de la cible, ils se déplacent et changent d’échelle avec lui.\",\n [\"Your build spells, with your worn jewelry joined under them.\"] = \"Vos sorts de configuration, avec vos bijoux équipés regroupés en dessous.\",\n [\"Your experience bar. It can stand upright too (below).\"] = \"Votre barre d’expérience. Elle peut aussi être verticale (ci-dessous).\",\n [\"Your friends' frames in co-op. They show now even if you're alone, so you can place them. Choose a column or a row, face plates or thin lines, and whether you join them.\"] = \"Les cadres de vos amis en coopération. Ils s’affichent même si vous êtes seul afin de pouvoir les placer. Choisissez une colonne ou une ligne, des portraits ou des lignes fines, et si vous rejoignez le groupe.\",\n [\"Your hero's frame: health, power and level. Drag the green handle to place it; its size and scale are below.\"] = \"Cadre de votre héros : santé, puissance et niveau. Faites glisser la poignée verte pour le placer ; sa taille et son échelle sont ci-dessous.\",\n [\"Your newest hits and heals, each with its spell icon. Crits stand out.\"] = \"Vos derniers coups et soins, chacun avec son icône de sort. Les critiques ressortent.\",\n [\"Your read-only presets will appear here. Applying one creates your editable copy.\"] = \"Vos préréglages en lecture seule apparaîtront ici. En appliquer un crée une copie modifiable.\",\n [\"Your real-world clock: 12/24-hour, its background and daylight saving are below.\"] = \"Votre horloge locale : format 12/24 heures, arrière-plan et heure d’été se règlent ci-dessous.\",\n [\"Your run's tally.\"] = \"Le récapitulatif de votre partie.\",\n [\"Your spells. Drag to place it; its size, and turning it upright, are below.\"] = \"Vos sorts. Faites-les glisser pour les placer ; leur taille et leur orientation se règlent ci-dessous.\",\n [\"Zelda: final four notes\"] = \"Zelda : quatre dernières notes\",\n [\"Zone and Heroic affixes\"] = \"Zone et affixes héroïques\",\n [\"all movable UI elements are back at their addon defaults.\"] = \"Tous les éléments déplaçables ont retrouvé leur position par défaut.\",\n [\"auto\"] = \"automatique\",\n [\"build\"] = \"build\",\n [\"cache\"] = \"cache\",\n [\"camera zoom is the game's own.\"] = \"le zoom de caméra est celui du jeu.\",\n [\"down\"] = \"bas\",\n [\"duck toy sound\"] = \"son de canard en jouet\",\n [\"element positions are in the action log: /slimsuite log\"] = \"les positions des éléments sont dans le journal d'actions : /slimsuite log\",\n [\"enter a profile name (char: names are reserved). \"] = \"Saisissez un nom de profil (les noms « char: » sont réservés). \",\n [\"frame sizes are in the action log: /slimsuite log\"] = \"les tailles de cadre sont dans le journal d'actions : /slimsuite log\",\n [\"frames will move independently now.\"] = \"Les cadres se déplaceront désormais indépendamment.\",\n [\"interface\"] = \"interface\",\n [\"movable elements are back at their original locations.\"] = \"Les éléments déplaçables ont retrouvé leur emplacement d’origine.\",\n [\"nearby frames will latch together when you move them.\"] = \"Les cadres proches s’aligneront lorsque vous les déplacerez.\",\n [\"next boss in\"] = \"prochain boss dans\",\n [\"no words are hidden. /slim hide <words> hides chat lines with them.\"] = \"aucun mot n'est masqué. /slim hide <mots> masque les lignes de discussion qui les contiennent.\",\n [\"nothing to redo.\"] = \"rien à rétablir.\",\n [\"nothing to undo.\"] = \"rien à annuler.\",\n [\"now  ->  with +10% luck\"] = \"maintenant  ->  avec +10% de chance\",\n [\"off\"] = \"désactivé\",\n [\"on\"] = \"activé\",\n [\"per-character:\"] = \"par personnage :\",\n [\"pillar man jojo\"] = \"pillar man jojo\",\n [\"profile deleted.\"] = \"Profil supprimé.\",\n [\"screen\"] = \"écran\",\n [\"select a saved profile first.\"] = \"Sélectionnez d'abord un profil enregistré.\",\n [\"template for\"] = \"pour\",\n [\"that is a read-only default profile. Apply it to create a My Custom Profile copy first.\"] = \"C'est un profil par défaut en lecture seule. Appliquez-le d'abord pour créer une copie « Mon profil personnalisé ».\",\n [\"that text is not a Slim Suite layout.\"] = \"Ce texte ne correspond pas à une disposition Slim Suite.\",\n [\"the UI is locked.\"] = \"L’interface est verrouillée.\",\n [\"the frame label is off.\"] = \"L’étiquette du cadre est désactivée.\",\n [\"the frame under your cursor is named next to it. /slimsuite mouse turns it off.\"] = \"Le nom du cadre sous le curseur s’affiche à côté. /slimsuite mouse désactive cette option.\",\n [\"the imported layout is now in use. Enter a profile name and import again to save it.\"] = \"La disposition importée est maintenant utilisée. Saisissez un nom de profil et importez à nouveau pour l'enregistrer.\",\n [\"the imported profile bundle is saved. Select a profile to apply it.\"] = \"Le lot de profils importé est enregistré. Sélectionnez un profil pour l'appliquer.\",\n [\"the minimap button is back.\"] = \"Le bouton de la minicarte est rétabli.\",\n [\"the minimap button is hidden. /slimsuite minimap brings it back.\"] = \"Le bouton de la minicarte est masqué. /slimsuite minimap le réaffiche.\",\n [\"the original size is not available yet; try again after the frame appears.\"] = \"La taille d’origine n’est pas encore disponible ; réessayez lorsque le cadre apparaîtra.\",\n [\"the pasted layout is in use.\"] = \"La disposition collée est appliquée.\",\n [\"the setup hit a problem and closed; your UI is back as it was. /slim errors shows what happened.\"] = \"la configuration a rencontré un problème et s'est fermée ; votre interface est comme avant. /slim errors montre ce qui s'est passé.\",\n [\"there are no named profiles to export yet.\"] = \"Il n'y a pas encore de profils nommés à exporter.\",\n [\"this client cannot change the minimap's shape.\"] = \"Ce client ne peut pas changer la forme de la minicarte.\",\n [\"up\"] = \"haut\",\n [\"usage: /slim camera save <name> [yards]. Names start with a letter.\"] = \"utilisation : /slim camera save <nom> [mètres]. Les noms commencent par une lettre.\",\n};"
SS.LOCALE_SOURCE.itIT = "return {\n [\"   ...and Guardians and lairs before they're pulled\"] = \"   ...e Guardiani e tane prima del combattimento\",\n [\"   Show their name\"] = \"   Mostra il loro nome\",\n [\"   Show their raid icon\"] = \"   Mostra la loro icona da incursione\",\n [\"%s is On but at 0%% opacity, so it can't be seen.\"] = \"%s è acceso ma allo 0%% di opacità, quindi non si vede.\",\n [\"(Right click element to change settings)\"] = \"(Clic destro sull'elemento per modificarne le impostazioni)\",\n [\"+%.2f pts\"] = \"+%.2f pt\",\n [\"+1 hour\"] = \"+1 ora\",\n [\"-1 hour\"] = \"-1 ora\",\n [\"/slim camera <yards>, +, -, <preset>, save <name> [yards], delete <name>, list, on, off.\"] = \"/slim camera <metri>, +, -, <preimpostazione>, save <nome> [metri], delete <nome>, list, on, off.\",\n [\"/slim camera: the distance now. /slim camera <yards>, +, -, <preset>, save <name> [yards], delete <name>, list, on, off.\"] = \"/slim camera: la distanza attuale. /slim camera <metri>, +, -, <preimpostazione>, save <nome> [metri], delete <nome>, list, on, off.\",\n [\"/slim demo: Demo Mode on or off.  /slim levelup: Slim Suite's Level Up button or the game's own.\"] = \"/slim demo: modalità dimostrativa accesa o spenta.  /slim levelup: il pulsante di salita di livello di Slim Suite o quello del gioco.\",\n [\"/slim hide <words>, /slim unhide <words>, /slim hide: chat lines with those words.\"] = \"/slim hide <parole>, /slim unhide <parole>, /slim hide: righe di chat con quelle parole.\",\n [\"/slim hud: recommended positions for this display.\"] = \"/slim hud: posizioni consigliate per questo schermo.\",\n [\"/slim layout save <name>, load <name>, delete <name>, list. The window shares a layout as text.\"] = \"/slim layout save <nome>, load <nome>, delete <nome>, list. La finestra condivide una disposizione come testo.\",\n [\"/slim layout: manage named profiles and import/export layouts.  /slim layout save <name>, load <name>, delete <name>, list.\"] = \"/slim layout: gestisci i profili con nome e importa/esporta disposizioni.  /slim layout save <nome>, load <nome>, delete <nome>, list.\",\n [\"/slim minimap: the gear button.  /slim errors: the error log.  /slim mouse: names the frame under the cursor.\"] = \"/slim minimap: il pulsante a ingranaggio.  /slim errors: il registro errori.  /slim mouse: nomina il riquadro sotto il cursore.\",\n [\"/slim positions: write where every element sits (position, size, scale) to the action log.\"] = \"/slim positions: scrive dove si trova ogni elemento (posizione, dimensione, scala) nel registro azioni.\",\n [\"/slim reset places puts every element back where it started; /slim reset all also resets sizes, scales and layouts.\"] = \"/slim reset places rimette ogni elemento al suo posto iniziale; /slim reset all ripristina anche dimensioni, scale e disposizioni.\",\n [\"/slim reset places, /slim reset all: back to where everything started.\"] = \"/slim reset places, /slim reset all: tutto torna dove è cominciato.\",\n [\"/slim: the settings window.  /slim edit: move and size the UI (/slim lock when done).  /slim setup: the guided setup.\"] = \"/slim: la finestra delle impostazioni.  /slim edit: sposta e ridimensiona l'interfaccia (/slim lock quando hai finito).  /slim setup: la configurazione guidata.\",\n [\"24-hour time\"] = \"Formato a 24 ore\",\n [\"3D portrait\"] = \"Ritratto 3D\",\n [\"3D portrait on the new-school frame\"] = \"Ritratto 3D nel riquadro moderno\",\n [\"A Swiss-army knife of useful tools and UI controls.\"] = \"Una raccolta di strumenti e controlli utili per l'interfaccia.\",\n [\"A million little problems\"] = \"A million little problems\",\n [\"A stat the game sends that Slim Suite has no description for yet.\"] = \"Una statistica inviata dal gioco che Slim Suite non descrive ancora.\",\n [\"Above the player frame\"] = \"Sopra il riquadro del giocatore\",\n [\"Above the target frame\"] = \"Sopra il riquadro del bersaglio\",\n [\"Absorb amounts\"] = \"Quantità assorbite\",\n [\"Accessibility\"] = \"Accessibilità\",\n [\"According to the records\"] = \"According to the records\",\n [\"Action bar\"] = \"Barra delle azioni\",\n [\"Active buffs\"] = \"Benefici attivi\",\n [\"Add your racial as a 7th button\"] = \"Aggiungi l'abilità razziale come settimo pulsante\",\n [\"Addon interface:\"] = \"Interfaccia dell'addon:\",\n [\"Addon version\"] = \"Versione dell'addon\",\n [\"Addons\"] = \"Addon\",\n [\"Advanced Options\"] = \"Opzioni avanzate\",\n [\"Aethus creations\"] = \"Creazioni di Aethus\",\n [\"All elements start disabled on a new install. Enable one to show and move it; Default restores the game's original element. Right-click its name for settings. Your Default profiles will appear beside this list.\"] = \"Alla prima installazione tutti gli elementi sono disattivati. Attivane uno per mostrarlo e spostarlo; Predefinito ripristina l'elemento originale del gioco. Clic destro sul nome per le impostazioni. I profili predefiniti appariranno accanto a questo elenco.\",\n [\"All set\"] = \"Tutto pronto\",\n [\"Also write the numbers in the combat log\"] = \"Scrivi i numeri anche nel registro di combattimento\",\n [\"Amulets\"] = \"Amuleti\",\n [\"Announcements\"] = \"Annunci\",\n [\"Anywhere\"] = \"Ovunque\",\n [\"Applied %s preset for %sx%s. Repositioned %d enabled elements; Default and Disabled elements stayed in place. Save a profile first if you want an easy way back.\"] = \"Applicata la preimpostazione %s per %sx%s. Riposizionati %d elementi attivi; gli elementi Predefiniti e Disattivati sono rimasti al loro posto. Salva prima un profilo per poter tornare facilmente indietro.\",\n [\"Applied the\"] = \"Applicato:\",\n [\"Apply recommended positions\"] = \"Applica posizioni consigliate\",\n [\"Apply selected\"] = \"Applica selezionato\",\n [\"Applying a read-only preset creates your editable copy.\"] = \"Applicare una preimpostazione di sola lettura crea una copia modificabile.\",\n [\"Area\"] = \"Area\",\n [\"At the start of the run\"] = \"All'inizio della partita\",\n [\"Available\"] = \"Disponibile\",\n [\"Awaiting API support\"] = \"Awaiting API support\",\n [\"Azeroth Survivors compatibility\"] = \"Compatibilità con Azeroth Survivors\",\n [\"Baby Crying\"] = \"Pianto di neonato\",\n [\"Back\"] = \"Indietro\",\n [\"Bar height\"] = \"Altezza della barra\",\n [\"Bearings to known bosses, lairs and caches. Choose a rail or free markers.\"] = \"Direzioni di boss, covi e forzieri noti. Scegli una scala o indicatori liberi.\",\n [\"Below the player frame\"] = \"Sotto il riquadro del giocatore\",\n [\"Below the target frame\"] = \"Sotto il riquadro del bersaglio\",\n [\"Big hits stand out\"] = \"Colpi forti in risalto\",\n [\"Black border around the bar\"] = \"Bordo nero intorno alla barra\",\n [\"Boss\"] = \"Boss\",\n [\"Boss / guardian / lair kill sound\"] = \"Suono uccisione boss o guardiano\",\n [\"Boss colour\"] = \"Colore boss\",\n [\"Boss damage only\"] = \"Solo danni ai boss\",\n [\"Boss debuffs on nameplates\"] = \"Penalità dei boss sulle targhe\",\n [\"Boss names\"] = \"Nomi dei boss\",\n [\"Boss raid icons\"] = \"Icone da incursione dei boss\",\n [\"Boss, Guardian and elite health bars.\"] = \"Barre della salute di boss, Guardiani ed élite.\",\n [\"Bosses\"] = \"Boss\",\n [\"Bottom\"] = \"In basso\",\n [\"Buffs and debuffs\"] = \"Benefici e penalità\",\n [\"Buffs join the player frame\"] = \"Benefici sul riquadro del giocatore\",\n [\"Buffs leave their own place and join the player frame\"] = \"I benefici lasciano il loro posto e si agganciano al riquadro del giocatore\",\n [\"Buffs/Debuffs\"] = \"Benefici/Penalità\",\n [\"Buffs/Debuffs on the player frame\"] = \"Benefici/Penalità nel riquadro del giocatore\",\n [\"Build and stats beside card choices\"] = \"Build e statistiche ai bordi delle carte\",\n [\"Build rows\"] = \"Righe della configurazione\",\n [\"Button row (optional)\"] = \"Riga di pulsanti (facoltativa)\",\n [\"CSGO Okay Let’s Go\"] = \"CSGO Okay Let’s Go\",\n [\"C